      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我正好有把平板放在包包里，于是我立刻\n拿出来下载应用程序，做好各种设定后──",
      "source_fingerprint": "676c677d0dbb1894bcbe9a62966d651a1e650c8ad450e0a3b3200b13d41eaf76",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
